WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.234 --> 00:00:03.601
-There are shocking new details

00:00:03.601 --> 00:00:05.000
in the investigation of
the January 6th insurrection,

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:07.367
including a PowerPoint plan
for overturning the election

00:00:07.367 --> 00:00:10.300
and an attempt to intimidate
a Georgia election worker,

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:12.334
that make it very clear
Donald Trump and his gang

00:00:12.334 --> 00:00:13.868
were trying to stage a coup

00:00:13.868 --> 00:00:15.367
and came very close
to succeeding.

00:00:15.367 --> 00:00:18.167
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:18.167 --> 00:00:20.100
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:22.167 --> 00:00:24.334
As we near
the one-year anniversary

00:00:24.334 --> 00:00:26.300
of the Capitol insurrection,
it's important to remember

00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:28.467
just how terrifying
and unpredictable that day was.

00:00:28.467 --> 00:00:29.767
For example, I remember,

00:00:29.767 --> 00:00:31.968
instead of taping our show
in the afternoon,

00:00:31.968 --> 00:00:34.501
we postponed it
and did it live that night

00:00:34.501 --> 00:00:36.167
because there was no way
of knowing

00:00:36.167 --> 00:00:37.467
how things were going to end.

00:00:37.467 --> 00:00:39.734
And we never postpone
our tapings

00:00:39.734 --> 00:00:41.534
because we all
have places to be.

00:00:41.534 --> 00:00:43.000
I have to get home to my family.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:44.901
Shoemaker has to get
to the dog track.

00:00:44.901 --> 00:00:46.234
Jim and John,
our security guards,

00:00:46.234 --> 00:00:47.701
have to get to the dog track.

00:00:47.701 --> 00:00:50.701
The crew has to get to the d--
It's mostly dog track related.

00:00:53.667 --> 00:00:55.567
I should clarify,
they don't go to bet on dogs.

00:00:55.567 --> 00:00:57.834
They go to rescue them, but I do
not think it's going very well.

00:00:57.834 --> 00:00:59.601
Every morning, they show up
with fresh scratches.

00:00:59.601 --> 00:01:01.133
When we try to find out
what happened,

00:01:01.133 --> 00:01:04.067
they just say, "Don't ask."

00:01:04.067 --> 00:01:06.200
Point is, it's important
to remember January 6th

00:01:06.200 --> 00:01:08.534
and to document each time
new details emerge,

00:01:08.534 --> 00:01:11.033
which, incredibly,
continues to happen,

00:01:11.033 --> 00:01:12.501
with each piece
of new information

00:01:12.501 --> 00:01:14.033
being more insane than the last.

00:01:14.033 --> 00:01:15.934
I don't know how it's possible.
It's like "Succession."

00:01:15.934 --> 00:01:17.934
Just when you think
it's getting repetitive,

00:01:17.934 --> 00:01:19.467
they find a new way
to shock you.

00:01:19.467 --> 00:01:21.834
And, by the way, I haven't seen
last night's episode yet,

00:01:21.834 --> 00:01:23.133
so no one spoil it for me.

00:01:23.133 --> 00:01:25.000
I don't want anyone
shouting out plot twists,

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:27.534
and I certainly don't want Wally
teasing me via cue card.

00:01:29.234 --> 00:01:30.834
Wally, no!

00:01:30.834 --> 00:01:32.534
[ Laughter ]

00:01:39.534 --> 00:01:43.400
Do we have to eat later after
Wally made a meal of that?

00:01:47.601 --> 00:01:50.033
The point is,
it is now beyond doubt,

00:01:50.033 --> 00:01:51.300
if there was any to begin with,

00:01:51.300 --> 00:01:53.334
that Trump and his gang
tried to stage a coup

00:01:53.334 --> 00:01:54.734
to overturn
a presidential election.

00:01:54.734 --> 00:01:56.467
They came incredibly close
to pulling it off.

00:01:56.467 --> 00:01:58.300
And it's very likely
they'll try again.

00:01:58.300 --> 00:01:59.968
In fact, we know Trump
would like to try it again

00:01:59.968 --> 00:02:01.667
because he keeps
talking about it,

00:02:01.667 --> 00:02:04.534
as he did over the weekend
at a so-called history tour

00:02:04.534 --> 00:02:06.968
with disgraced former
Fox News host Bill O'Reilly.

00:02:06.968 --> 00:02:12.167
-Mike, had he had the courage
to do what Thomas Jefferson did

00:02:12.167 --> 00:02:13.400
but a minor version --

00:02:13.400 --> 00:02:16.634
You know, Thomas Jefferson,
he kept Georgia.

00:02:16.634 --> 00:02:18.767
You know that?
He didn't send it back.

00:02:18.767 --> 00:02:20.200
There was a dispute.

00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:21.701
Hear ye, hear ye.

00:02:21.701 --> 00:02:24.000
The great state of Georgia

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:28.467
is unable to properly
calculate its votes.

00:02:28.467 --> 00:02:30.501
Thomas Jefferson was sitting
where Mike was,

00:02:30.501 --> 00:02:33.100
right where Mike --
You know what he said?

00:02:33.100 --> 00:02:34.601
"Hear ye, hear ye.

00:02:34.601 --> 00:02:38.200
We will keep the votes
of the great state of Georgia."

00:02:38.200 --> 00:02:40.534
He didn't send it back
to the legis-- No.

00:02:40.534 --> 00:02:44.200
All I wanted and a lot of people
wanted Mike to do

00:02:44.200 --> 00:02:45.968
is send them back.

00:02:45.968 --> 00:02:48.667
-I'll say this --
He's the only guy I've ever seen

00:02:48.667 --> 00:02:53.167
do an episode of "Drunk History"
stone-cold sober.

00:02:53.167 --> 00:02:56.968
I mean, it's like watching
an amnesia patient

00:02:56.968 --> 00:02:59.968
wander up onstage during
a performance of "Hamilton."

00:02:59.968 --> 00:03:03.200
-Secretary Jefferson,
you have the floor, sir.

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:06.367
-Hear ye, hear ye.

00:03:06.367 --> 00:03:09.767
-It's, frankly, hilarious
that the only thing

00:03:09.767 --> 00:03:11.701
Trump seems to know
about American history

00:03:11.701 --> 00:03:15.501
is that people used to say,
"Hear ye, hear ye."

00:03:15.501 --> 00:03:18.400
And he probably only knows that
from one of those commercials

00:03:18.400 --> 00:03:20.367
where the owner
of a local car dealership

00:03:20.367 --> 00:03:22.734
dresses up as a founding father
for an ad

00:03:22.734 --> 00:03:24.834
advertising
a Presidents' Day sale.

00:03:24.834 --> 00:03:26.501
"Hear ye, hear ye!
Come on down

00:03:26.501 --> 00:03:29.834
to ye olde Joey Petrocelli's
Kia dealership of Staten Island.

00:03:29.834 --> 00:03:32.267
These prices are so low,
you'll have to two it by land,

00:03:32.267 --> 00:03:36.033
one if by sea...for yourself."

00:03:36.033 --> 00:03:38.834
By the way, Trump is referencing
a debunked theory

00:03:38.834 --> 00:03:41.467
floated by his supporters
that Thomas Jefferson

00:03:41.467 --> 00:03:43.734
somehow used his power
as vice president

00:03:43.734 --> 00:03:46.200
overseeing the counting
of electoral votes in 1800

00:03:46.200 --> 00:03:47.601
to make himself president,

00:03:47.601 --> 00:03:49.868
a theory disproven by,
among others,

00:03:49.868 --> 00:03:51.267
an article with the headline...

00:03:54.934 --> 00:03:57.601
It's a real sign of the times
how many headlines

00:03:57.601 --> 00:04:01.667
sound like they should start
with a big old, heavy sigh.

00:04:07.534 --> 00:04:09.534
With all due respect
to O'Reilly and Trump,

00:04:09.534 --> 00:04:11.334
we might as well
get our history tour

00:04:11.334 --> 00:04:13.701
from a gym teacher
who had to sub in last-minute

00:04:13.701 --> 00:04:15.667
because the real teacher
had a COVID exposure.

00:04:15.667 --> 00:04:16.968
"Who we doing today, Jefferson?

00:04:16.968 --> 00:04:19.634
Okay, bear with Coach
because it's been a while

00:04:19.634 --> 00:04:22.167
since I cracked open
them history books.

00:04:22.167 --> 00:04:25.901
Oh, boy. If memory serves,
Jefferson ran on two platforms.

00:04:25.901 --> 00:04:27.901
One, don't let fish fry
in the kitchen,

00:04:27.901 --> 00:04:30.434
and, two, don't let beans
burn on the grill.

00:04:33.234 --> 00:04:34.734
And after his presidency,

00:04:34.734 --> 00:04:37.968
he moved on up to the east side,
okay.

00:04:37.968 --> 00:04:39.501
To Monticello,
which is what he called

00:04:39.501 --> 00:04:40.868
his deluxe apartment in the sky.

00:04:40.868 --> 00:04:42.534
Alright, let's do laps!"

00:04:42.534 --> 00:04:43.667
By the way...

00:04:47.367 --> 00:04:48.434
...while we're talking about it,

00:04:48.434 --> 00:04:50.100
I just feel like
it's worth pointing out

00:04:50.100 --> 00:04:52.100
that ticket sales for this
Trump/O'Reilly history tour

00:04:52.100 --> 00:04:53.267
have been lackluster.

00:04:53.267 --> 00:04:55.334
Photos of the first event
in Sunrise, Florida,

00:04:55.334 --> 00:04:57.100
showed lots of empty seats
in the arena,

00:04:57.100 --> 00:04:58.767
and the "South Florida
Sun Sentinel" reported that...

00:05:03.901 --> 00:05:06.167
Yikes! I mean,
there was better attendance

00:05:06.167 --> 00:05:07.934
at my son's kindergarten
holiday pageant --

00:05:07.934 --> 00:05:10.234
or there would have been had it
not been canceled due to COVID,

00:05:10.234 --> 00:05:12.701
which is a real shame, because
my son would have killed it

00:05:12.701 --> 00:05:16.033
as a wise man, because I've been
teaching him my Pacino.

00:05:16.033 --> 00:05:19.133
[ As Pacino ] Whoa,
did somebody order the myrrh?

00:05:22.534 --> 00:05:25.534
Joseph, that kid
does not look like you.

00:05:29.267 --> 00:05:31.667
[ Normal voice ]
The juxtaposition --

00:05:31.667 --> 00:05:33.968
The juxtaposition --

00:05:33.968 --> 00:05:35.334
[ As Pacino ] Jo--

00:05:38.234 --> 00:05:40.467
We got to talk to Joseph.

00:05:40.467 --> 00:05:44.033
No, frankincense won't fix it."

00:05:44.033 --> 00:05:46.200
[ Normal voice ]
The juxtaposition here
is so revealing

00:05:46.200 --> 00:05:47.834
because it's
a vivid demonstration

00:05:47.834 --> 00:05:49.367
of how deeply unpopular he is,

00:05:49.367 --> 00:05:52.100
which is why he needed to stage
a coup to stay in power.

00:05:52.100 --> 00:05:53.501
And we have
overwhelming evidence

00:05:53.501 --> 00:05:54.901
that that's exactly
what happened.

00:05:54.901 --> 00:05:57.300
They did everything they could,
left no stone unturned,

00:05:57.300 --> 00:05:59.167
looked for every crack
and crevice in our democracy

00:05:59.167 --> 00:06:00.434
they could possibly find.

00:06:00.434 --> 00:06:02.801
Their lawyers filed tons
of bogus lawsuits

00:06:02.801 --> 00:06:04.634
and flew around the country
trying to get lawmakers

00:06:04.634 --> 00:06:06.167
to overturn
their state's results,

00:06:06.167 --> 00:06:07.968
forced an unnecessary recount
in Georgia

00:06:07.968 --> 00:06:10.200
to confirm Biden's win
a third time,

00:06:10.200 --> 00:06:11.701
pressured the governor
to call a special session

00:06:11.701 --> 00:06:13.000
to reject the votes,

00:06:13.000 --> 00:06:15.834
tried to send alternate slates
of electors to D.C.,

00:06:15.834 --> 00:06:17.367
leaned on the Georgia
secretary of state

00:06:17.367 --> 00:06:19.267
to find enough votes
to overturn the result,

00:06:19.267 --> 00:06:20.501
tried to get the U.S. attorney

00:06:20.501 --> 00:06:22.934
to announce
that there was widespread fraud,

00:06:22.934 --> 00:06:24.267
tried to get
the Justice Department

00:06:24.267 --> 00:06:25.601
to declare that there was fraud,

00:06:25.601 --> 00:06:29.200
wrote memo after memo
laying out steps Mike Pence

00:06:29.200 --> 00:06:30.567
could have taken
to overturn the result,

00:06:30.567 --> 00:06:32.033
called up individual senators

00:06:32.033 --> 00:06:33.868
to get them to reject
the electoral votes,

00:06:33.868 --> 00:06:35.868
and called Mike Pence
into the Oval Office

00:06:35.868 --> 00:06:38.467
to personally bully him
into rejecting the results.

00:06:38.467 --> 00:06:40.067
Trump tried
so many different avenues.

00:06:40.067 --> 00:06:41.434
He was like the guy
at the grocery store

00:06:41.434 --> 00:06:42.534
during the Christmas rush

00:06:42.534 --> 00:06:44.300
who keeps switching
checkout aisles.

00:06:44.300 --> 00:06:45.868
You got to wait, buddy.

00:06:45.868 --> 00:06:49.634
There's no secret line that's
shorter than the other lines.

00:06:49.634 --> 00:06:52.467
You don't like lines, go fight
with the self-checkout machine

00:06:52.467 --> 00:06:53.667
like everyone else.

00:06:53.667 --> 00:06:55.434
-Please place your item
in the bag.

00:06:55.434 --> 00:06:56.501
-I already bagged it.

00:06:56.501 --> 00:06:58.133
-Please place your item
in the bag.

00:06:58.133 --> 00:06:59.167
-It's in the bag!

00:06:59.167 --> 00:07:00.834
-Please wait for assistance.

00:07:00.834 --> 00:07:02.467
-Son of a bitch!

00:07:09.400 --> 00:07:12.200
And when Pence said
he didn't have that power,

00:07:12.200 --> 00:07:13.968
Trump even went so far
as to say...

00:07:17.901 --> 00:07:20.767
Did he say that while
peeking over his sunglasses,

00:07:20.767 --> 00:07:23.934
"Risky Business" style?

00:07:23.934 --> 00:07:27.033
It's so disorienting for things
to be both this dangerous

00:07:27.033 --> 00:07:29.000
and this dumb at the same time.

00:07:29.000 --> 00:07:31.067
Like, how are we supposed
to process this?

00:07:31.067 --> 00:07:33.534
It was both
a very real coup attempt

00:07:33.534 --> 00:07:35.567
that continues to pose
a clear and present danger

00:07:35.567 --> 00:07:36.868
to our democracy

00:07:36.868 --> 00:07:39.634
and also one of the dumbest
things to ever happen.

00:07:39.634 --> 00:07:41.701
It's like if you found out
this guy

00:07:41.701 --> 00:07:44.300
was a prolific serial killer.

00:07:44.300 --> 00:07:45.534
-Whaa!

00:07:45.534 --> 00:07:47.267
[ Crowd groans ]

00:07:47.267 --> 00:07:48.901
-Like, all the defense
would have to do

00:07:48.901 --> 00:07:50.767
is show that video and say,
"You really think my client

00:07:50.767 --> 00:07:53.868
is capable of luring innocent
victims into his basement?

00:07:53.868 --> 00:07:55.334
He tried to cannonball
through the ice."

00:07:55.334 --> 00:07:56.400
And then that guy would say,

00:07:56.400 --> 00:07:58.033
"I would never want
to break the ice.

00:07:58.033 --> 00:08:01.000
That's where the bodies are."

00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:02.334
And the lawyer would be like,
"Shh!"

00:08:02.334 --> 00:08:03.968
He's like, "No,
you have to keep them there

00:08:03.968 --> 00:08:05.567
or else they start to smell."

00:08:09.534 --> 00:08:11.067
It's a f-- we're having fun.

00:08:11.067 --> 00:08:12.934
Look.

00:08:12.934 --> 00:08:15.300
And yet somehow things
keep getting

00:08:15.300 --> 00:08:18.734
both more dangerous and dumber,
'cause in the last few days,

00:08:18.734 --> 00:08:20.234
we've learned
some shocking new details,

00:08:20.234 --> 00:08:22.567
including the existence
of a truly insane

00:08:22.567 --> 00:08:25.601
PowerPoint presentation
that was circling in Trumpworld

00:08:25.601 --> 00:08:27.234
laying out the steps for a coup.

00:08:27.234 --> 00:08:30.300
-Another shocking twist
in the January 6th investigation

00:08:30.300 --> 00:08:32.834
now places
a retired U.S. Army colonel

00:08:32.834 --> 00:08:35.467
at the center of efforts
to overturn the 2020 election.

00:08:35.467 --> 00:08:38.300
"The Washington Post" reporting
Phil Waldron,

00:08:38.300 --> 00:08:42.267
who circulated a proposal to
challenge the election results,

00:08:42.267 --> 00:08:46.133
visited the White House many
times after Joe Biden's victory.

00:08:46.133 --> 00:08:48.434
And during those visits,
he allegedly spoke

00:08:48.434 --> 00:08:52.767
with former White House
Chief of Staff Mark Meadows

00:08:52.767 --> 00:08:56.434
"between 8 and 10
separate times,"

00:08:56.434 --> 00:08:57.801
worked alongside
Trump's legal team,

00:08:57.801 --> 00:09:00.501
and even briefed
several members of Congress

00:09:00.501 --> 00:09:01.734
on the eve of the insurrection

00:09:01.734 --> 00:09:04.334
about how to stop
the election's certification.

00:09:04.334 --> 00:09:08.300
-This is that 38-page
PowerPoint presentation,

00:09:08.300 --> 00:09:11.133
unlike any other PowerPoint you
or I have ever seen, I'm sure,

00:09:11.133 --> 00:09:13.601
that includes options
like President Trump

00:09:13.601 --> 00:09:17.100
declaring a national emergency
to stop that from happening.

00:09:17.100 --> 00:09:19.667
And "The Washington Post"
is reporting that Waldron

00:09:19.667 --> 00:09:23.133
personally spoke to Meadows
about this PowerPoint.

00:09:23.133 --> 00:09:24.801
-That's right --
They wrote down their plans

00:09:24.801 --> 00:09:26.667
for a coup in a PowerPoint.

00:09:26.667 --> 00:09:27.901
You know what that means

00:09:27.901 --> 00:09:32.467
Congress is going to
have to subpoena Clippy.

00:09:32.467 --> 00:09:36.634
That's from our new segment
"Jokes From 1995."

00:09:36.634 --> 00:09:38.534
Now, famously, Trump never
writes anything down,

00:09:38.534 --> 00:09:40.200
but I guess he forgot
to tell his underlings

00:09:40.200 --> 00:09:42.367
before they started
e-mailing a PowerPoint around

00:09:42.367 --> 00:09:43.601
detailing their crimes.

00:09:43.601 --> 00:09:45.834
Even the mafia knows
to use code words.

00:09:45.834 --> 00:09:48.300
If the Mafia ever made
a PowerPoint presentation,

00:09:48.300 --> 00:09:49.801
it would say
something vague like...

00:09:52.033 --> 00:09:53.734
"Okay, boss,
what's the next slide?"

00:09:53.734 --> 00:09:56.400
"There's no more slides.

00:09:56.400 --> 00:09:58.734
There's just the one slide."

00:09:58.734 --> 00:10:00.367
All of that weren't
already insane enough,

00:10:00.367 --> 00:10:04.133
we also have this bizarre
plot twist involving a publicist

00:10:04.133 --> 00:10:06.033
who tried to pressure
a Georgia election worker

00:10:06.033 --> 00:10:08.334
into publicly confessing
to bogus fraud charges.

00:10:08.334 --> 00:10:10.100
-Well, it sure looks
like another piece

00:10:10.100 --> 00:10:13.133
of the Trump coup plot
is exposed in Georgia.

00:10:13.133 --> 00:10:15.100
-Bombshell reporting
from Reuters.

00:10:15.100 --> 00:10:19.467
A Kanye West publicist pressured
a Georgia election worker

00:10:19.467 --> 00:10:22.501
to confess to bogus
election fraud

00:10:22.501 --> 00:10:24.734
two days before January 6th.

00:10:24.734 --> 00:10:28.801
-We come to a woman
named Ruby Freeman.

00:10:28.801 --> 00:10:31.701
She is a Georgia
election worker.

00:10:31.701 --> 00:10:35.767
She was smeared by,
among others, Donald Trump,

00:10:35.767 --> 00:10:39.868
who mentioned her name
18 times in that phone call

00:10:39.868 --> 00:10:41.334
to the secretary of state.

00:10:41.334 --> 00:10:44.501
A woman named Trevian Kutti

00:10:44.501 --> 00:10:48.000
showed up at
Ruby Freeman's doorstep.

00:10:48.000 --> 00:10:50.934
She said she was representing
a high-profile individual

00:10:50.934 --> 00:10:52.667
who wanted to help Freeman.

00:10:52.667 --> 00:10:54.200
What Kutti did not reveal

00:10:54.200 --> 00:10:58.601
is that she was a publicist
to Kanye West,

00:10:58.601 --> 00:11:02.033
a Trump ally who himself
ran a halfhearted campaign

00:11:02.033 --> 00:11:03.868
for president in 2020.

00:11:03.868 --> 00:11:06.234
So she agrees to meet
with Kanye's publicist

00:11:06.234 --> 00:11:09.234
in a safe location,
a local police station,

00:11:09.234 --> 00:11:11.267
where Kutti outlined a threat

00:11:11.267 --> 00:11:14.067
wherein mysterious figures
would show up to Freeman's house

00:11:14.067 --> 00:11:17.033
and put her
and her family in jail

00:11:17.033 --> 00:11:18.868
if she did not publicly admit

00:11:18.868 --> 00:11:21.167
to stealing the election
for Joe Biden.

